  "description": {
    "short": "Connect, map, and query data across Databricks Unity Catalog, PostgreSQL, MySQL, Snowflake, and more with AI-powered schema mapping.",
    "long": "DataOne is a comprehensive data integration platform that brings together multiple data sources into a unified interface. Seamlessly connect to Databricks Unity Catalog alongside traditional databases like PostgreSQL, MySQL, and Snowflake. Use AI-powered schema mapping to automatically align schemas across sources, execute federated queries, and maintain data lineage - all while respecting Unity Catalog permissions and governance policies.\n\nKey Features:\n• **Multi-Source Connectivity**: Native Databricks Unity Catalog integration plus support for 10+ database types\n• **AI-Powered Schema Mapping**: LLM-assisted mapping suggestions with confidence scores and explanations\n• **Federated Query Studio**: Write and execute queries across multiple data sources in one place\n• **Unity Catalog Delegation**: Leverage Unity Catalog's native lineage, classification, and RBAC\n• **Real-Time Drift Detection**: Automatic monitoring of schema changes across all sources\n• **Role-Based Access Control**: OAuth-based authentication with Unity Catalog permission inheritance\n• **Audit Trail**: Complete history of all data operations and transformations\n\nDataOne follows a 4R modernization strategy:\n• **Retire**: Eliminates redundant metadata storage by delegating to Unity Catalog\n• **Delegate**: Uses Unity Catalog for lineage, PII classification, and access control\n• **Adapt**: Extends Unity Catalog metadata with cross-source mapping capabilities\n• **Keep**: Maintains multi-source support for heterogeneous environments"
  },
